Another test:
`var_dump(Demo::find()->asArray()->all());` returns

```
array (size=2)
  0 => 
    array (size=2)
      'id' => string '1' (length=1)
      'test' => string '�' (length=1)
  1 => 
    array (size=2)
      'id' => string '2' (length=1)
      'test' => string '' (length=1)
```

```
$result = Demo::find()->asArray()->all();
        foreach ($result as $row) {
            if ($row['test'] === chr(0x00)) {
                echo '0x00 <br />';
            } elseif ($row['test'] === chr(0x01)) {
                echo '0x01 <br />';
            }
        }
```

returns: 

```
0x00
0x01
```
